{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:57 2026-10-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:57 2026-10-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:57 2026-10-25 HKT</p><img alt=\"七人車停路中，男司機涉酒駕但未超標。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/182c43afd3edbebb9744c5e2874a2905/2026-10/FotoJet_16.jpg\"/><p>九龍城發生酒駕案。今日（25日）早上9時40分，一輛白色七人車停在賈炳達道與龍崗道交界的路中心，阻礙交通。途人發現司機倒臥在七人車內，懷疑有人暈倒於是報警。警員趕到現場，發現七人車上載有男司機和一名女乘客，其間將兩人帶上警車調查，證實男司機曾經飲酒，但沒有超標。事件亦不涉及毒後駕駛，警方作出口頭警告後，男司機和女乘客獲放行，自行駕車離開。</p><img alt=\"男司機曾飲酒但無超標，其後獲放行。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f711f76638adb2c38d3875fd22c122e/2026-10/7_2_5.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1630717ca81a107fc78647884aba9ba/2026-10/6_0_8.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員向七人車男司機調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fab096e0aa4a69bb02fa7646293ba53a/2026-10/5_13.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"七人車停在路中阻礙交通。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b83dd8c65f63d286cf3b95e0a7eac2ed/2026-10/1_1_29.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ea59b3ad8c73f7c8f72b52f8aa56201/2026-10/2_23.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/845eccd1234257b67a97949ffb9d7738/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_11_16_28_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6f19c2c7e120d6f6ccf3daaedfe70f9/2026-10/3_0_16.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"女乘客同獲放行離開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e9b03a014c5070bb6d887efd8403344/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_11_16_27_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:06.243958+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":253,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T03:57:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:33.534492+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:52.674863+00:00","content_hash":"119714208810673144bc7b0503758e8b51ddfe0be128e5c8f56dadae85208631","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}